    "Helmke et al. 2018, SESAR PJ.16-04 command ontology",
    "Chen et al. 2023, MITRE-DLR ontology comparison",
    "Keller 2017, NASA ATM Ontology (atmonto) for static classes",
    "FAA JO 7110.65 2-4-3 and ICAO Doc 4444 for readback requirements"
  ],
